      "zh": "但即使這樣，或許也對未來的我要求太高。",
      "hasZh": true,
      "placeholder": false,
      "mappedToEnglish": true,
      "mappedToZhKey": true,
      "zhKeyValue": "但即使這樣，或許也對未來的我要求太高。"
    },
    {
      "id": "113",
      "timecode": "00:04:39,044 --> 00:04:43,177",
      "english": "Maybe one day I won't be able to write or work on projects anymore.",
      "zh": "或許有一天我寫不了字、做不了專案。",
      "hasZh": true,
      "placeholder": false,
      "mappedToEnglish": true,
      "mappedToZhKey": true,
      "zhKeyValue": "或許有一天我寫不了字、做不了專案。"
    },
    {
      "id": "114",
      "timecode": "00:04:44,157 --> 00:04:47,595",
      "english": "Maybe I will just sit by a window, listen to music,",
      "zh": "",
      "hasZh": false,
      "placeholder": true,
      "mappedToEnglish": true,
      "mappedToZhKey": true,
      "zhKeyValue": "也許我就坐在窗邊，聽聽音樂，"
    },
    {
      "id": "115",
      "timecode": "00:04:47,865 --> 00:04:49,569",
      "english": "eat something I still enjoy,",
      "zh": "吃點仍覺得好吃的東西，",
      "hasZh": true,
      "placeholder": false,
      "mappedToEnglish": true,
      "mappedToZhKey": true,
      "zhKeyValue": "吃點仍覺得好吃的東西，"
    },
    {
      "id": "116",
      "timecode": "00:04:49,796 --> 00:04:51,870",
      "english": "and talk to someone once in a while.",
      "zh": "偶爾跟人說說話。",
      "hasZh": true,
      "placeholder": false,
      "mappedToEnglish": true,
      "mappedToZhKey": true,
      "zhKeyValue": "偶爾跟人說說話。"
    },
    {
      "id": "117",
      "timecode": "00:04:52,850 --> 00:04:54,725",
      "english": "If I am not in constant pain,",
      "zh": "",
      "hasZh": false,
      "placeholder": true,
      "mappedToEnglish": true,
      "mappedToZhKey": true,
      "zhKeyValue": "若無長期疼痛，"
    },
    {
      "id": "118",
      "timecode": "00:04:54,939 --> 00:04:55,862",
      "english": "perhaps that would be",
      "zh": "",
      "hasZh": false,
      "placeholder": true,
      "mappedToEnglish": true,
      "mappedToZhKey": true,
      "zhKeyValue": "或許那也是"
    },
    {
      "id": "119",
      "timecode": "00:04:55,876 --> 00:04:57,240",
      "english": "a pretty good day too.",
      "zh": "",
      "hasZh": false,
      "placeholder": true,
      "mappedToEnglish": true,
      "mappedToZhKey": true,
      "zhKeyValue": "不錯的一天。"
    },
    {
      "id": "120",
      "timecode": "00:04:58,940 --> 00:05:02,449",
      "english": "It would be easy to turn aging into another performance target:",
      "zh": "很容易把變老變成另一項績效指標：",
      "hasZh": true,
      "placeholder": false,
      "mappedToEnglish": true,
      "mappedToZhKey": true,
      "zhKeyValue": "很容易把變老變成另一項績效指標："
    },
    {
      "id": "121",
      "timecode": "00:05:02,662 --> 00:05:04,778",
      "english": "stay curious, stay productive,",
      "zh": "",
      "hasZh": false,
      "placeholder": true,
      "mappedToEnglish": true,
      "mappedToZhKey": true,
      "zhKeyValue": "保持好奇、保持產出、"
    },
    {
      "id": "122",
      "timecode": "00:05:05,062 --> 00:05:07,122",
      "english": "remain useful until the very end.",
      "zh": "",
      "hasZh": false,
      "placeholder": true,
      "mappedToEnglish": true,
      "mappedToZhKey": true,
      "zhKeyValue": "到最後一刻仍有用。"
    },
    {
      "id": "123",
      "timecode": "00:05:08,109 --> 00:05:10,907",
      "english": "Maybe growing old gracefully also means knowing",
      "zh": "",
      "hasZh": false,
      "placeholder": true,
      "mappedToEnglish": true,
      "mappedToZhKey": true,
      "zhKeyValue": "也許體面地老去，"
    },
    {
      "id": "124",
      "timecode": "00:05:10,921 --> 00:05:13,791",
      "english": "when I no longer have to prove any of those things.",
      "zh": "",
      "hasZh": false,
      "placeholder": true,
      "mappedToEnglish": true,
      "mappedToZhKey": true,
      "zhKeyValue": "就是知道何時不必再證明那些事。"
    },
    {
      "id": "125",
      "timecode": "00:05:15,476 --> 00:05:20,540",
      "english": "And perhaps there is one more thing I hope I can let go of. Regret.",
      "zh": "",
      "hasZh": false,
      "placeholder": true,
      "mappedToEnglish": true,
      "mappedToZhKey": true,
      "zhKeyValue": "或許還有一件事，我希望能放下後悔。"
    },
    {
      "id": "126",
      "timecode": "00:05:21,520 --> 00:05:27,102",
      "english": "My eighty-year-old self may look back at me today and say: You had enough money.",
      "zh": "",
      "hasZh": false,
      "placeholder": true,
      "mappedToEnglish": true,
      "mappedToZhKey": true,
      "zhKeyValue": "八十歲的我可能回頭看現在的我說：你錢夠了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "127",
      "timecode": "00:05:28,082 --> 00:05:31,548",
      "english": "Why didn't you stop working earlier and do what you really wanted?",
      "zh": "",
      "hasZh": false,
      "placeholder": true,
      "mappedToEnglish": true,
      "mappedToZhKey": true,
      "zhKeyValue": "為何不早點停下來，做真正想做的事？"
    },
    {
      "id": "128",
      "timecode": "00:05:32,528 --> 00:05:35,753",
      "english": "Or he may say: You needed the money.",
      "zh": "",
      "hasZh": false,
      "placeholder": true,
      "mappedToEnglish": true,
      "mappedToZhKey": true,
      "zhKeyValue": "或者他會說：你需要錢。"
    },
    {
      "id": "129",
      "timecode": "00:05:36,733 --> 00:05:38,721",
      "english": "Why didn't you work a few more years",
      "zh": "",
      "hasZh": false,
      "placeholder": true,
      "mappedToEnglish": true,
      "mappedToZhKey": true,
      "zhKeyValue": "為何趁還能工作時"
    },
    {
      "id": "130",
      "timecode": "00:05:38,736 --> 00:05:39,858",
      "english": "while you still could?",
      "zh": "",
      "hasZh": false,
      "placeholder": true,
      "mappedToEnglish": true,
      "mappedToZhKey": true,
      "zhKeyValue": "不多幹幾年？"
    },
    {
      "id": "131",
      "timecode": "00:05:41,540 --> 00:05:42,037",
      "english": "I don't know",
      "zh": "",
      "hasZh": false,
      "placeholder": true,
      "mappedToEnglish": true,
      "mappedToZhKey": true,
      "zhKeyValue": "我不知道"
    },
    {
      "id": "132",
      "timecode": "00:05:42,051 --> 00:05:42,790",
      "english": "which old man",
      "zh": "",
      "hasZh": false,
      "placeholder": true,
      "mappedToEnglish": true,
      "mappedToZhKey": true,
      "zhKeyValue": "我會變成"
    },
    {
      "id": "133",
      "timecode": "00:05:42,804 --> 00:05:43,628",
      "english": "I will become.",
      "zh": "",
      "hasZh": false,
      "placeholder": true,
      "mappedToEnglish": true,
      "mappedToZhKey": true,
      "zhKeyValue": "哪種老人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "134",
      "timecode": "00:05:44,615 --> 00:05:45,993",
      "english": "I have to make decisions",
      "zh": "",
      "hasZh": false,
      "placeholder": true,
      "mappedToEnglish": true,
      "mappedToZhKey": true,
      "zhKeyValue": "我得"
    },
    {
      "id": "135",
      "timecode": "00:05:46,007 --> 00:05:47,186",
      "english": "now without knowing how",
      "zh": "",
      "hasZh": false,
      "placeholder": true,
      "mappedToEnglish": true,
      "mappedToZhKey": true,
      "zhKeyValue": "在不知結局時"
    },
    {
      "id": "136",
      "timecode": "00:05:47,200 --> 00:05:48,649",
      "english": "the story turns out.",
      "zh": "",
      "hasZh": false,
      "placeholder": true,
      "mappedToEnglish": true,
      "mappedToZhKey": true,
      "zhKeyValue": "做決定。"
    },
    {
      "id": "137",
      "timecode": "00:05:49,629 --> 00:05:50,766",
      "english": "Maybe that is what",
      "zh": "",
      "hasZh": false,
      "placeholder": true,
      "mappedToEnglish": true,
      "mappedToZhKey": true,
      "zhKeyValue": "也許這就是"
    },
    {
      "id": "138",
      "timecode": "00:05:50,780 --> 00:05:52,442",
      "english": "makes regret so unfair.",
      "zh": "",
      "hasZh": false,
      "placeholder": true,
      "mappedToEnglish": true,
      "mappedToZhKey": true,
      "zhKeyValue": "後悔最不公平的地方。"
    },
    {
      "id": "139",
      "timecode": "00:05:53,422 --> 00:05:54,984",
      "english": "We judge our younger selves",
      "zh": "",
      "hasZh": false,
      "placeholder": true,
      "mappedToEnglish": true,
      "mappedToZhKey": true,
      "zhKeyValue": "我們用年輕的自己"
    },
    {
      "id": "140",
      "timecode": "00:05:54,999 --> 00:05:56,774",
      "english": "with information they never had.",
      "zh": "",
      "hasZh": false,
      "placeholder": true,
      "mappedToEnglish": true,
      "mappedToZhKey": true,
      "zhKeyValue": "從未擁有的資訊，來審判他們。"
    },
    {
      "id": "141",
      "timecode": "00:05:58,460 --> 00:06:01,684",
      "english": "So perhaps growing old gracefully is not reaching the end",
      "zh": "",
      "hasZh": false,
      "placeholder": true,
      "mappedToEnglish": true,
      "mappedToZhKey": true,
      "zhKeyValue": "也許體面地老去，"
    },
    {
      "id": "142",
      "timecode": "00:06:01,699 --> 00:06:04,383",
      "english": "and discovering that I made all the right choices.",
      "zh": "",
      "hasZh": false,
      "placeholder": true,
      "mappedToEnglish": true,
      "mappedToZhKey": true,
      "zhKeyValue": "不是走到終點發現全對了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "143",
      "timecode": "00:06:05,370 --> 00:06:07,274",
      "english": "Perhaps it is being able to look back",
      "zh": "",
      "hasZh": false,
      "placeholder": true,
      "mappedToEnglish": true,
      "mappedToZhKey": true,
      "zhKeyValue": "而是能回頭"
    },
    {
      "id": "144",
      "timecode": "00:06:07,288 --> 00:06:09,305",
      "english": "at the person I used to be and say:",
      "zh": "",
      "hasZh": false,
      "placeholder": true,
      "mappedToEnglish": true,
      "mappedToZhKey": true,
      "zhKeyValue": "看著過去的自己說："
    },
    {
      "id": "145",
      "timecode": "00:06:10,285 --> 00:06:11,691",
      "english": "You made the best choices you",
      "zh": "",
      "hasZh": false,
      "placeholder": true,
      "mappedToEnglish": true,
      "mappedToZhKey": true,
      "zhKeyValue": "你用當時擁有的認知，"
    },
    {
      "id": "146",
      "timecode": "00:06:11,705 --> 00:06:13,197",
      "english": "could with what you knew then.",
      "zh": "",
      "hasZh": false,
      "placeholder": true,
      "mappedToEnglish": true,
      "mappedToZhKey": true,
      "zhKeyValue": "做了最好的選擇。"
    },
    {
      "id": "147",
      "timecode": "00:06:14,177 --> 00:06:15,441",
      "english": "Don't spend what's left",
      "zh": "",
      "hasZh": false,
      "placeholder": true,
      "mappedToEnglish": true,
      "mappedToZhKey": true,
      "zhKeyValue": "別把剩下的時間"
    },
    {
      "id": "148",
      "timecode": "00:06:15,455 --> 00:06:17,231",
      "english": "regretting the choices you made.",
      "zh": "",
      "hasZh": false,
      "placeholder": true,
      "mappedToEnglish": true,
      "mappedToZhKey": true,
      "zhKeyValue": "花在後悔那些選擇上。"
    },
    {
      "id": "149",
      "timecode": "00:06:18,211 --> 00:06:20,058",
      "english": "There isn't that much road ahead.",
      "zh": "前路不長了。",
      "hasZh": true,
      "placeholder": false,
      "mappedToEnglish": true,
      "mappedToZhKey": true,
      "zhKeyValue": "前路不長了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "150",
      "timecode": "00:06:21,038 --> 00:06:23,069",
      "english": "Just live the last part of the journey.",
      "zh": "就好好走完旅程的最後一程。",
      "hasZh": true,
      "placeholder": false,
      "mappedToEnglish": true,
      "mappedToZhKey": true,
      "zhKeyValue": "就好好走完旅程的最後一程。"
    }
  ]
}
